    "image_with_text_KpFALN": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ymM4Ga": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Empowering 5000+ Farmers,Cultivating 9800 Acres of FertileLand & Delivering Worldwide",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_3cRX8F": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We proudly support over 5000 farmers, nurturing 9800 acres of organic farmland under NPOP (National Programme for Organic Production) and NOP (National Organic Program) standards and producing 26,300+ MTPA of premium milk. With a commitment to sustainable farming and fair in comes, we bring farm-fresh goodness to homes across India and 36 countries worldwide. Together, we're building a healthier, greener future for the upcoming generations.</p>",
