    "image_with_text_nknmHk": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ithtUa": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Indian Breed Cow Milk",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_E73LNf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We source our milk from <strong>Indian breed cows</strong>, untouched by human hands and processed using fully automated machines. This ensures a clean, hygienic, and natural process from farm to packaging raised under close supervision by our farmers on organic farms. These cows, including breeds like Badri, Gir, and Sahiwal cows, feed on natural fodder, providing A2 milk known for its digestibility and nutritional benefits. Rich in protein, particularly in whey and casein, It is a good choice for growing children, pregnant mothers, and the elderly. Our organic cow milk is packaged in 6 layers using UHT technology, ensuring that the milk remains free from pesticides, synthetic hormones, and harmful additives. It tastes farm-fresh and delivered directly to your doorstep.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_ithtUa",
        "text_E73LNf"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".section-template--18815213142272__image_with_text_nknmHk-padding {background: #005e36;}",
